{"seq":3,"slug":"system-design-interview","title":"系统设计面试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/job-interview-skills/interview-techniques/system-design-interview","wordCount":1690,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"系统设计面试\">系统设计面试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>系统设计面试是中高级技术岗位的标配环节。它考察的不是你对某个具体技术的了解，而是你将业务需求转化为可扩展技术方案的能力。一个好的系统设计回答展示了需求分析、架构设计、技术选型和权衡取舍的完整思考过程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[需求分析] --&gt; B[容量估算]&#10;    B --&gt; C[高层架构]&#10;    C --&gt; D[核心组件设计]&#10;    D --&gt; E[数据模型]&#10;    E --&gt; F[可扩展性]&#10;    F --&gt; G[权衡讨论]&#10;    G -.-&gt;|迭代| C\">graph LR\n    A[需求分析] --&gt; B[容量估算]\n    B --&gt; C[高层架构]\n    C --&gt; D[核心组件设计]\n    D --&gt; E[数据模型]\n    E --&gt; F[可扩展性]\n    F --&gt; G[权衡讨论]\n    G -.-&gt;|迭代| C</pre><p>系统设计面试没有标准答案——同一个问题可以有多种合理的架构方案。面试官关注的是你的思考过程、沟通能力和做出设计决策时的权衡逻辑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>面试阶段</th>\n<th>时间分配</th>\n<th>核心产出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>需求澄清</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>功能/非功能需求清单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量估算</td>\n<td>3 分钟</td>\n<td>QPS、存储、带宽估算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高层架构</td>\n<td>10 分钟</td>\n<td>核心组件和数据流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>详细设计</td>\n<td>15 分钟</td>\n<td>关键组件的实现细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展讨论</td>\n<td>7 分钟</td>\n<td>可扩展性、容错、监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"系统设计的结构化方法\">系统设计的结构化方法</h2><p>需求分析阶段要主动提问而非等待面试官说明。功能需求（系统需要做什么）和非功能需求（性能、可用性、一致性）都需要明确。很多候选人在这个阶段过于仓促，导致后续设计方向偏离面试官的预期。</p>\n<p>容量估算帮助你做出合理的技术选型。日活用户 100 万的系统和日活 1 亿的系统，在架构上有本质区别。即使估算不需要精确到个位，了解数量级对选择正确的技术方案至关重要。</p>\n<p>高层架构设计从画出核心组件和它们之间的关系开始。使用标准的方块图展示客户端、API 网关、应用服务、缓存层、数据库和消息队列等组件。每个组件的选择都需要解释理由——为什么用 Redis 做缓存、为什么选择 NoSQL 而非关系型数据库。</p>\n<p>详细设计阶段深入 1-2 个核心组件。这里展示你的技术深度和实际经验。例如，设计一个消息系统时，详细讨论消息的存储方案、投递保证和已读状态同步等关键问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见系统设计题型\">常见系统设计题型</h2><p>经典的系统设计题包括：设计 URL 缩短服务、设计消息系统、设计新闻推送流、设计搜索引擎、设计分布式缓存等。每种题型都有一些标准的解决方案和需要讨论的权衡点。</p>\n<p>准备系统设计面试的有效方法是学习经典系统的架构。阅读 Twitter、Instagram、WhatsApp 等知名系统的架构博文，理解它们在不同规模下的演进历程。真正有价值的不是记住某个具体架构，而是理解&quot;为什么这样设计&quot;和&quot;如果需求变化会怎样调整&quot;。</p>\n<p>在面试中，展示你的实际经验比展示书本知识更有说服力。当讨论到某个技术选型时，如果你有相关的实战经验，主动分享你在实际项目中遇到的问题和解决方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量估算的数学-把直觉变成数字\">容量估算的数学：把直觉变成数字</h2><p>容量估算是很多候选人最薄弱的环节，但它恰恰是面试官判断你&quot;是否真懂规模&quot;的快速探针。掌握几个基本换算即可从容应对。</p>\n<p>假设一个系统日活用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DAU = 10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（1 亿），每个用户每天平均发起 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 次请求，则平均 QPS 为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mn>86400</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mn>86400</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">QPS_{avg} = \\frac{DAU \\times r}{86400} = \\frac{10^8 \\times 20}{86400} \\approx 2.3 \\times 10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">QP</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">86400</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">86400</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>考虑流量并非均匀分布，峰值通常按平均值的 2-3 倍估算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">QPS_{peak} \\approx 3 \\times QPS_{avg} \\approx 7 \\times 10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">QP</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">QP</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>存储估算同理。若每条记录约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>KB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 1\\text{KB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span></span></span></span></span>，每天新增写入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = 10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 条，则一年存储增量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>365</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>KB</mtext><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>365</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.65</mn><mtext> TB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Storage_{year} = s \\times W \\times 365 \\approx 1\\text{KB} \\times 10^7 \\times 365 \\approx 3.65\\ \\text{TB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.65</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这些数字本身不需要精确，关键是让面试官看到：你能从&quot;日活 1 亿&quot;推导出&quot;峰值约 7 万 QPS、年增约 3.6TB&quot;，从而合理地选择缓存策略、分库分表方案和带宽预算。数量级对了，技术选型才站得住脚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ai-时代系统设计面试的权重上升与反模式\">AI 时代系统设计面试的权重上升与反模式</h2><p>随着 AI 接管大量编码工作，系统设计与架构思维成为 2026 年高级岗位最核心的区分项——当执行被自动化，&quot;设计什么、为什么这样设计&quot;的判断力变得更稀缺。这也是系统设计面试在中高级岗位权重持续上升的原因。</p>\n<p>常见反模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>跳过需求澄清直接画图</strong>：拿到&quot;设计 X&quot;就开始堆组件。需求分析（功能 vs 非功能、读写比、一致性要求）是第一步也是最重要的一步，仓促开始会导致整个设计跑偏。</li>\n<li><strong>背诵标准答案</strong>：把&quot;设计 Twitter&quot;的某个架构图背下来照搬。系统设计没有唯一答案，面试官考的是权衡过程——为什么用 Redis、为什么选 NoSQL，每个选择都要给理由。</li>\n<li><strong>不做容量估算</strong>：跳过数字直接选型。没有数量级支撑的技术选型（如&quot;用消息队列削峰&quot;）显得是套路而非判断。</li>\n<li><strong>只讲优点不讲代价</strong>：每个方案都说&quot;很好&quot;。成熟的设计者会主动指出方案的代价（&quot;这样写性能好，但一致性会变弱&quot;），这正是面试官想看到的工程成熟度。</li>\n<li><strong>闷头设计不沟通</strong>：把面试当独立答题。系统设计是协作过程——边画边说、主动征求面试官意见、根据反馈迭代。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>权衡的本质：系统设计永远是在多个相互冲突的目标（一致性 vs 可用性、性能 vs 成本、简单 vs 可扩展）之间做取舍。CAP 定理就是这种张力的经典表达。面试官评估的不是你&quot;知道哪个架构最好&quot;，而是你&quot;能否在给定约束下做出有理有据的取舍并清晰表达&quot;。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>延伸：编码层面的考察见 <a href=\"technical-interview\">技术面试准备与应对</a>；AI 如何改变软件设计本身，见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../ai-era-programmer-growth/ai-software-design/\">AI 时代程序员成长</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((系统设计))&#10;    结构化方法&#10;      需求分析&#10;      容量估算&#10;      高层架构&#10;      详细设计&#10;    核心能力&#10;      抽象思维&#10;      权衡取舍&#10;      沟通表达&#10;    准备方法&#10;      经典系统学习&#10;      模拟练习&#10;      实战经验积累&#10;    面试策略&#10;      主动提问&#10;      画图沟通&#10;      展示思考过程\">mindmap\n  root((系统设计))\n    结构化方法\n      需求分析\n      容量估算\n      高层架构\n      详细设计\n    核心能力\n      抽象思维\n      权衡取舍\n      沟通表达\n    准备方法\n      经典系统学习\n      模拟练习\n      实战经验积累\n    面试策略\n      主动提问\n      画图沟通\n      展示思考过程</pre><ul>\n<li>系统设计面试考察的是思考过程和权衡能力</li>\n<li>需求分析是第一步也是最重要的一步</li>\n<li>容量估算帮助做出合理的技术选型</li>\n<li>学习经典系统架构，理解设计决策背后的逻辑</li>\n<li>展示实际经验比展示书本知识更有说服力</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"系统设计面试","id":"系统设计面试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"系统设计的结构化方法","id":"系统设计的结构化方法"},{"level":2,"text":"常见系统设计题型","id":"常见系统设计题型"},{"level":2,"text":"容量估算的数学：把直觉变成数字","id":"容量估算的数学-把直觉变成数字"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 时代系统设计面试的权重上升与反模式","id":"ai-时代系统设计面试的权重上升与反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"技术面试准备与应对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/job-interview-skills/interview-techniques/technical-interview"},"next":{"title":"面试心态与临场表现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/job-interview-skills/interview-techniques/interview-mindset"}}